{"problem_id": "dc587aba-bd1f-42ad-aea5-4594df55b349", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 11, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:45:54.033313+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-08-27T10:45:54.033313+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_2", "parent_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.548566+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­же­ны гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"y=f(x)\"></span>  и ка­са­тель­ная к нему в точке с абс­цис­сой <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>. Най­ди­те зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) в точке <i>x</i><sub>0</sub>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.548566+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/></p><p>Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной, ко­то­рый в свою оче­редь равен тан­ген­су угла на­кло­на дан­ной ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс. По­стро­им тре­уголь­ник с вер­ши­на­ми в точ­ках <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var> (2; −4), <var data-math-identifier=\"B\">B</var> (2; 3), <var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var> (7; −4). Угол на­кло­на ка­са­тель­ной к оси абс­цисс будет равен углу, смеж­но­му с углом <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var>:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y'(x_0)=\\tg (180^{\\circ}-\\angle ACB)=-\\tg \\angle ACB=-\\frac{AB}{AC}=-\\frac{7}{5}=-1{,}4\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.548566+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:53:04.548566+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "b3177fab-bf98-4e68-9e39-fdfc4edd5d08", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "1e2d1a81-0567-4c8e-91df-756cb5335ce6", "asset_key": "image_2", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"b3177fab-bf98-4e